{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"spell_crown_of_night","model_identifier":"spell_crown_of_night","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# spell_crown_of_night\n\nMorvath's Crown of night (puts out every light within 30 m): a black ring of smoke with a faint violet underglow at its leading edge that rolls outward along the ground from him. Lights go dark as it passes them. At rest the ring has a radius of 16 u.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -20..20, y 0..6.5, z -20..20 units (1.1 x 0.18 x 1.1 m) at rest; 30 m radius and about 16 u high at the end of `spread`. Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 16 x 16, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 72.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- none (an effect; the game puts out lights as the ring's radius passes them: radius = 16 u x the `ring` bone's x scale)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `spread` | 1.5 | once | the `ring` bone widens in x and z from 0.5x to 66.75x (radius 8 u to 1068 u = 30 m), fast at first (12x at 0.3 s, 40x at 0.8 s), and grows to 2.5x taller; the 24 puffs bob up and down out of step so the smoke seems to churn and roll; it ends at full size (the game fades it) |\n\n- The ring is 24 overlapping puff segments, each turned round Y by a holder group `turn_<n>` (15 degree steps), so no cube is rotated. Stretching the `ring` bone in x and z keeps the ring closed at every size; the band of smoke widens with it (about 4 m wide at 30 m), which reads as a rolling wall of smoke from above.\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_ember_0 to glow_ember_23 (the violet edge, so the ring reads in the dark it makes).\n\n## Notes\n\n- Bright simple shapes; every lit cube is named `glow_*` (flat colours; the game may scale, spin and fade them). No particles or lights in the file.\n- Made by the model thread (review of batch 2): the bot's batches left this wishlist entry out.\n"},"resolution":{"width":16,"height":16},"elements":[{"name":"smoke_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-2.6943951023931954,0.0,-19.0],"to":[2.6943951023931954,4.0,-13.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,-16.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[6,0,11.38879020478639,4.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[6,0,11.38879020478639,4.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,6,6.0,10.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,6,6.0,10.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,5.388790204786391,6.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0,0,5.388790204786391,6.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"ccb67805-ceaa-58cd-91bb-0d30f290f11f"},{"name":"smoke_top_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.6166370614359171,4.0,-18.0],"to":[1.6166370614359171,6.5,-14.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,-16.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[6,10,9.233274122871833,12.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[6,10,9.233274122871833,12.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[10,10,14.0,12.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[10,10,14.0,12.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[6,6,9.233274122871833,10.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[6,6,9.233274122871833,10.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"9f009eeb-36b1-5192-970a-8c43d1053f40"},{"name":"glow_ember_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.8860765716752366,0.0,-19.6],"to":[1.8860765716752366,0.6,-19.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,-16.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[8,13,11.772153143350472,13.6],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[8,13,11.772153143350472,13.6],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,15,0.6000000000000014,15.6],"texture":0},"